OL,3,GNEWSAFirst giant tuna caught off
OL,4,AYorkshire since 1960s
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Atlantic bluefin tuna has been
OL,7,Fcaught and brought to shore on the
OL,8,FYorkshire coast for the first time in
OL,9,Fan estimated 60 years.
OL,11,FThe giant fish had not been landed in
OL,12,Fthe North Sea since the 1960s due to
OL,13,Foverfishing and the depletion of
OL,14,Fherring shoals, according to
OL,15,Fresearchers from the University of
OL,16,FExeter who have now tagged six off
OL,17,FWhitby.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
